{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Define a lifecycle for stored references.** A `store`/`load`-only contract cannot reclaim a successful publication whose checkpoint fails, while backend cleanup without a specified retention horizon can break late replay, history inspection, or root decoding. Define cleanup ownership and minimum safe retention, or add commit/expiry/release support, with checkpoint-failure and late-replay tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ppygK","finding_digest":"cbd80416be2d263923233ff881c4ff9497a622d351208e9f464654df80f5c0ae","finding_id":"arf_v1_zpmaifv6futdsizdh74idrh7ss","finding_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::payload-lifecycle::safe-retention-horizon","identity_key":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md::payload-lifecycle::safe-retention-horizon","line":305,"observation_digest":"806ab0f01a2f521adb42cb0dfc8220e190d881c8a8845f8c136843d09503b19e","observation_id":"aro_v1_qbvlb4a2f5jbvw2czmg7zara4g","path":"docs/adr/006-java-payload-offloading.md","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zpmaifv6futdsizdh74idrh7ss","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:53:55Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3akhipwlxgh53mzfcxrph3hpjl","reviewed_base_sha":"54b01c910cb06c69336afcb2c5f3f220fbe7b0b0","reviewed_head_sha":"4d751be9025f5188d73fa525dd0e72105d864f40","reviewer":"codex","start_line":297,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":678},"record_id":"art_v1_pk7wzdtkhseokfmnqic3d7e3hn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:53:55Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
